    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📄 Resume Search Generator\n### Purpose\nThis workflow analyzes a resume and creates personalized LinkedIn job search filters.\n\n### How it Works\n1. Loads the user's preferences (Remote, Easy Apply, Max Jobs).\n2. Downloads and reads the resume PDF.\n3. Extracts the resume text.\n4. Gemini analyzes the resume.\n5. Generates 3–5 suitable job search filters as JSON.\n6. Saves the generated search filters to a Google Document.\n\n### Output\nA reusable list of job search filters (Keyword, Location, Experience Level) that can be used by the main job search workflow.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 624,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2960,
        -384
