      "id": "2d1ce8d7-1411-42b1-b562-d7c8e922f4b1",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔎 Automated Job Search Workflow\n### Purpose\nThis workflow finds matching LinkedIn jobs using the generated search filters and saves the results.\n\n### How it Works\n1. Reads the saved search filters from Google Docs.\n2. Builds LinkedIn search URLs.\n3. Searches LinkedIn jobs.\n4. Extracts job links and job details.\n5. Limits the number of jobs based on the configuration.\n6. Saves the final job details to Google Sheets for tracking.\n\n### Output\nA structured list of matching jobs with role, company, location, description, apply link, and status.",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 624,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2960,
