    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔐 Credentials Setup\nBefore running the workflow, connect these services:\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Create a Gemini API Key from Google AI Studio.\n- Add it as a Google Gemini credential in n8n.\n\n### Google Drive\n- Connect your Google account using OAuth2.\n- Used to download the resume PDF.\n\n### Google Docs\n- Connect the same Google account using OAuth2.\n- Used to save and read generated search filters.\n\n### Google Sheets\n- Connect using Google OAuth2.\n- Used to store and track job search results.\n\n**Note:** Use the same Google account for Drive, Docs, and Sheets to avoid permission issues.",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 656
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        -368
      ],
      "id": "ec97f83d-61e6-4e53-931b-f4223e0dda90",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const MAX_TOTAL = 10;\nconst MAX_PER_COMPANY = 2;\n\n// Extract the jobs array\nconst jobs = items[0].json.jobs || [];\n\n// Remove duplicate URLs first\nconst uniqueUrls = [...new Set(jobs)];\n\nconst companyCounts = {};\nconst filteredUrls = [];\n\nfor (const url of uniqueUrls) {\n\n    // Extract company slug from LinkedIn URL\n    // Example:\n    // custom-software-engineer-at-accenture-in-india-4438542291\n\n    const match = url.match(/-at-(.+?)-\\d+/i);\n\n    let company = \"unknown\";\n\n    if (match) {\n\n        company = match[1]\n            .replace(/-in-.*/i, \"\")\n            .toLowerCase()\n            .trim();\n\n    }\n\n    companyCounts[company] ??= 0;\n\n    if (companyCounts[company] >= MAX_PER_COMPANY) {\n        continue;\n    }\n\n    companyCounts[company]++;\n\n    filteredUrls.push(url);\n\n    if (filteredUrls.length >= MAX_TOTAL) {\n        break;\n    }\n}\n\nreturn [\n{\n    json: {\n        jobs: filteredUrls\n    }\n}\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -672,
        512
      ],
      "id": "3d9db769-1285-445c-9427-687f8dafdc2a",
      "name": "Filter URLs"
    }
